@base = http://localhost:3000
### /:slug

GET {{base}}/docker

### /:slug inexistente

GET  {{base}}/pyspark

### /api/links
GET {{base}}/api/links

### Crear link
POST {{base}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "slug":"java",
    "url":"https://academia.holamundo.io/courses/ultimate-javascript"
}

### Delete by ID
DELETE {{base}}/api/links/4

### Update a link
PUT {{base}}/api/links/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id":"4",
    "slug":"javacito",
    "url":"https://academia.holamundo.io/courses/ultimate-javascript"
}